Domain Entity School based on EducationOrganization
    documentation 'This entity represents an educational organization that includes staff and 
                  'students who participate in classes and educational activity groups.
    integer SchoolId
        documentation 'The identifier assigned to a school by the State Education Agency (SEA).
        renames identity property EducationOrganizationId
        is queryable field
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation 'The grade levels served at the school.
        is required collection
    enumeration SchoolCategory
        documentation 'The one or more categories of school. For example: High School, Middle School, 
                      'and/or Elementary School.
        is optional collection
    enumeration SchoolType
        documentation 'The type of education institution as classified by its primary focus. 
        is optional
    enumeration CharterStatus
        documentation 'A school or agency providing free public elementary or secondary education to 
                      'eligible students under a specific charter granted by the state legislature or 
                      'other appropriate authority and designated by such authority to be a charter 
                      'school.
        is optional
    enumeration TitleIPartASchoolDesignation
        documentation 'Denotes the Title I Part A designation for the school.
        is optional
    enumeration MagnetSpecialProgramEmphasisSchool
        documentation 'A school that has been designed: 1) to attract students of different 
                      'racial/ethnic backgrounds for the purpose of reducing, preventing, or 
                      'eliminating racial isolation; and/or 2) to provide an academic or social focus 
                      'on a particular theme (e.g., science/math, performing arts, gifted/talented, or 
                      'foreign language).
        is optional
    descriptor AdministrativeFundingControl
        documentation 'The type of education institution as classified by its funding source, for 
                      'example public or private.
        is optional
    enumeration InternetAccess
        documentation 'The type of Internet access available.
        is optional
    reference LocalEducationAgency
        documentation 'LEA of which the School is an organizational component.
        is optional
    enumeration CharterApprovalAgencyType
        documentation 'The type of agency that approved the establishment or continuation of a charter school.
        is optional
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation 'The school year in which a charter school was initially approved.
        is optional
        with context CharterApproval